message: >-
  If you use Novachrono in your work, please cite it using the following
  metadata.
title: Novachrono
type: software
version: 0.1.0

authors:
  - family-names: Steinberg
    given-names: Henning

url: https://github.com/drachenpapa/novachrono
repository-code: https://github.com/drachenpapa/novachrono

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  Novachrono is a self-hosted dashboard renderer for the Divoom Times Gate.
  It generates a consistent five-screen interface for information such as
  weather, time, events, and developer workflow metrics.

keywords:
  - Divoom
  - Times Gate
  - dashboard
  - Python
  - Raspberry Pi
  - pixel display
